# ── Credentialed data (MIMIC wall) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The cohort bundle (full750.csv / dev148.csv) is distributed separately to PhysioNet-
# credentialed users and must NEVER be committed here. This repo currently lives inside the
# `models` monorepo, whose root .gitignore happens to ignore *.csv — that incidental
# protection DISAPPEARS when this tree is extracted to a standalone public repo, so the
# cohort paths are named explicitly below rather than relying on it.
data/
**/full750.csv
**/dev148.csv
**/patients.csv
**/silver_patients.csv

# A local MIMIC copy or its converted Parquet, if someone points the tools at an in-tree path.
mimic-data/
*.parquet
*.csv.gz

# ── Policy corpus ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# benchmark/corpus/ is ASSEMBLED at runtime by construction/scripts/acquire_corpus.py and is
# never repo content: most of it is third-party text under publisher terms, and anything that
# lands in git history stays there even after deletion. Keep this rule absolute — do not add
# negations for individual documents.
benchmark/corpus/*
!benchmark/corpus/README.md

# Tracked instead: the acquisition manifest, and the subset that is US government work and so
# carries no redistribution restriction. corpus_manifest.csv needs an explicit negation because
# the monorepo root ignores *.csv (see the note at the top of this file).
!benchmark/corpus_manifest.csv

# Where acquire_corpus.py expects hand-downloaded publisher PDFs/EPUBs. Same rule as the corpus
# itself: these are third-party files under publisher terms and must never reach git history.
corpus-inbox/
corpus-build/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env

# ── Generated task dirs (regenerable via benchmark/scripts/build_tasks.py) ───
tasks/
tasks_*/

# ── Run outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
jobs/
.trajectories/

# ── Local caches (DuckDB views, the note-module cache, tool caches) ──────────
.cache/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
